  "description": "The proposal is for a single-storey rear/side infill extension to the existing mid-terrace dwelling at 23 Tradescant Road. The extension will:\n\nProject approximately 5.94 metres from the original rear wall of the house (within the 3–6 metre allowance for terraced properties);\n\nHave a width of approximately 2.085 metres along the side return;\n\nHave an eaves height of 2.8 metres and an overall height of 3.5 metres (below the 4-metre GPDO limit);\n\nUse matching external materials to the existing property;\n\nIncorporate roof glazing to maximise natural light;\n\nProvide an enlarged kitchen and WC area on the ground floor without altering access to the garden.\n\nThe extension will not be visible from the public highway and will have no adverse impact on the character of the property or neighbouring amenity.",
